WEBVTT

00:00:10.980 --> 00:00:13.360
<i>Hanamaru Kindergarten</i>

00:01:33.090 --> 00:01:35.480
Sensei, please accept my love!

00:01:35.640 --> 00:01:36.540
I can't do that.

00:01:36.830 --> 00:01:39.410
Why? Is the age gap too great?

00:01:39.450 --> 00:01:40.000
Yes.

00:01:40.250 --> 00:01:41.360
How can you say that?

00:01:41.360 --> 00:01:43.350
Love has nothing to do with age.

00:01:43.540 --> 00:01:44.220
It's impossible.

00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:45.680
After all...

00:01:46.410 --> 00:01:48.090
...you're a kindergarten student!

00:01:47.570 --> 00:01:51.480
You're so cruel, Tsuchi! How could you crush a young girl's feelings?

00:01:52.540 --> 00:01:55.120
You were the one that hit on me! Was it just a game to you?

00:01:55.120 --> 00:01:56.660
Don't say that!

00:01:56.660 --> 00:01:58.860
You can't fool me! Look at me!

00:01:58.010 --> 00:01:58.860
What a disaster.

00:01:58.860 --> 00:02:01.360
"A Hanamaru Love Triangle"

00:02:01.360 --> 00:02:02.400
"Sakura Class"

00:02:03.030 --> 00:02:05.300
Has everyone washed their hands?

00:02:05.300 --> 00:02:06.840
Yes!

00:02:06.930 --> 00:02:08.880
Try to eat everything.

00:02:09.310 --> 00:02:11.000
Okay, let's eat.

00:02:11.190 --> 00:02:13.730
Let's eat!

00:02:19.520 --> 00:02:21.120
What's wrong, Anzu-chan?

00:02:21.150 --> 00:02:25.800
I asked Tsuchi to date me again, but he wasn't honest with me.

00:02:26.100 --> 00:02:26.910
Date you?

00:02:27.460 --> 00:02:28.470
What a flirt.

00:02:28.870 --> 00:02:32.220
Did you confess your love to Tsuchida-sensei?

00:02:32.220 --> 00:02:33.050
What?

00:02:33.050 --> 00:02:34.190
A confession of love?

00:02:34.430 --> 00:02:36.190
Well, I guess so.

00:02:36.190 --> 00:02:39.670
There's no doubt Tsuchi likes me.

00:02:39.670 --> 00:02:43.270
He's just too shy to approach me.

00:02:43.400 --> 00:02:46.570
That's why I decided to tell him how I feel, but...

00:02:48.420 --> 00:02:49.780
Love is painful.

00:02:49.920 --> 00:02:53.230
The more your feelings grow, the more agonizing it becomes.

00:02:53.910 --> 00:02:55.470
Sounds rough, Anzu-chan.

00:02:55.540 --> 00:02:58.200
What does agonizing mean?

00:02:58.470 --> 00:03:00.670
She becomes so lonely she can't take it any more.

00:03:01.880 --> 00:03:04.590
What are they talking about?

00:03:05.520 --> 00:03:07.420
Did you meet the mayor of Nazamu?

00:03:08.140 --> 00:03:11.180
I found the storyteller of the dragon, but he disappeared.

00:03:11.750 --> 00:03:13.460
Are you talking about Dragon Quest IX?

00:03:13.540 --> 00:03:14.480
Yeah.

00:03:14.500 --> 00:03:17.250
I even got a reward from the mayor.

00:03:17.250 --> 00:03:18.470
From the mayor?

00:03:18.470 --> 00:03:22.090
I'm supposed to gather the ingredients for the "medicinal poultice," but I haven't been playing.

00:03:20.660 --> 00:03:22.370
The teacher's playing a game.

00:03:22.410 --> 00:03:23.850
Should he be doing that?

00:03:24.270 --> 00:03:26.830
Tsuchi's such a child!

00:03:26.880 --> 00:03:28.950
It's so adorable!

00:03:30.180 --> 00:03:34.220
Tsuchida-sensei, I fixed your apron.

00:03:35.850 --> 00:03:37.240
Thanks for all your help!

00:03:37.240 --> 00:03:40.440
It's no trouble at all. I said I would fix it.

00:03:40.640 --> 00:03:44.340
It's embarrassing to be a teacher that can't sew.

00:03:44.660 --> 00:03:46.530
I have a lot to learn from you, Yamamoto-sensei.

00:03:48.240 --> 00:03:50.660
Tsuchida-sensei is smiling.

00:03:50.920 --> 00:03:53.090
Could he be acting like that because...

00:03:53.090 --> 00:03:54.550
Could be.

00:03:54.710 --> 00:03:56.680
No!

00:03:57.250 --> 00:04:00.000
I'd be happy to help you any time.

00:04:00.260 --> 00:04:01.490
Thank you.

00:04:01.840 --> 00:04:04.220
But I'm not clumsy.

00:04:04.600 --> 00:04:08.850
As a student, I put together my friend's Master Grade...

00:04:09.110 --> 00:04:11.240
Tsuchi likes me.

00:04:15.710 --> 00:04:18.350
I guess you wouldn't know what a Master Grade is.

00:04:19.570 --> 00:04:23.510
A Master Grade has fewer parts than a Perfect Grade, but...

00:04:24.000 --> 00:04:26.540
...wait, what I am I explaining?

00:04:32.790 --> 00:04:34.780
What a fun game.

00:04:35.900 --> 00:04:37.120
Let me play, too!

00:04:45.540 --> 00:04:49.480
I-I'm sorry. It looked fun, so I...

00:04:49.960 --> 00:04:53.190
There's no need for you to apologize.

00:04:53.880 --> 00:04:55.440
What a blissful expression.

00:04:55.590 --> 00:04:57.830
You're easy to read, Tsuchida-sensei.

00:04:58.740 --> 00:05:01.460
I-I've got to do something about this.

00:05:04.400 --> 00:05:07.500
Let's review the human relationships.

00:05:09.030 --> 00:05:10.620
Hii-chan, you're so cool!

00:05:11.860 --> 00:05:12.610
Quiet down.

00:05:13.260 --> 00:05:15.970
First, Anzu-chan likes Tsuchida-sensei.

00:05:16.350 --> 00:05:18.790
Yes! I love Tsuchi!

00:05:20.250 --> 00:05:23.810
Next, Tsuchida-sensei may like Yamamoto-sensei.

00:05:24.160 --> 00:05:27.160
No, no, no!

00:05:26.010 --> 00:05:28.520
It's only a possibility.

00:05:30.630 --> 00:05:31.220
Ahem.

00:05:31.880 --> 00:05:35.610
This makes Yamamoto-sensei Anzu-chan's rival.

00:05:36.630 --> 00:05:39.100
This is a full-fledged love triangle.

00:05:39.640 --> 00:05:40.490
I have a question.

00:05:40.630 --> 00:05:42.580
What's a love triangle?

00:05:42.610 --> 00:05:45.090
It's a complicated romantic relationship for adults.

00:05:46.090 --> 00:05:49.580
Hooray! It's a love triangle!

00:05:50.060 --> 00:05:52.520
I'm an adult! Hooray!

00:05:50.670 --> 00:05:52.790
Wow, Anzu-chan.

00:05:54.440 --> 00:05:57.080
I don't think that's anything to be happy about.

00:05:59.840 --> 00:06:03.400
Even if she was just joking around, I can't believe she'd throw herself at me.

00:06:03.620 --> 00:06:06.430
Maybe Yamamoto-sensei really does...

00:06:08.120 --> 00:06:09.420
No, wait a minute.

00:06:09.700 --> 00:06:12.540
Can someone that beautiful fall in love with me?

00:06:15.120 --> 00:06:16.410
I suppose not.

00:06:16.890 --> 00:06:21.230
If Tsuchi and I become lovey-dovey, there's no problem at all.

00:06:21.900 --> 00:06:23.580
But how can I get him to do that?

00:06:24.080 --> 00:06:28.130
I thought you might say that, so I gathered some articles for reference.

00:06:29.390 --> 00:06:31.030
The top ten female celebrities.

00:06:31.500 --> 00:06:34.010
The top ranked celebrities all have at least a D-cup.

00:06:34.360 --> 00:06:35.960
Half of them are F-cups.

00:06:37.060 --> 00:06:38.480
So it is their chests.

00:06:38.590 --> 00:06:41.070
Hii-chan and Anzu-chan, you're both amazing.

00:06:41.330 --> 00:06:43.220
You can read books for adults.

00:06:43.900 --> 00:06:47.090
If Tsuchida-sensei is attracted to Yamamoto-sensei...

00:06:47.520 --> 00:06:50.610
...it's very likely he prefers women with large breasts.

00:06:51.560 --> 00:06:54.940
Which means there's only one thing to do!

00:07:00.800 --> 00:07:01.830
What a great idea!

00:07:02.710 --> 00:07:06.050
What do you think, Koume-chan? Am I sexy?

00:07:06.670 --> 00:07:08.980
You look just like Yamamoto-sensei.

00:07:10.330 --> 00:07:12.670
Hii-chan, that's enough air.

00:07:12.670 --> 00:07:15.680
"Concentrating heart and soul"

00:07:13.440 --> 00:07:15.590
Hii-chan! Hii-chan!

00:07:15.820 --> 00:07:18.120
Stop, stop, stop!

00:07:18.360 --> 00:07:19.470
Anzu-chan...

00:07:21.610 --> 00:07:24.320
I'm sorry. I got caught up in what I was doing.

00:07:24.860 --> 00:07:25.830
Don't worry about it.

00:07:27.750 --> 00:07:29.040
Next article.

00:07:29.710 --> 00:07:32.630
A survey of what men want from their girlfriends.

00:07:33.000 --> 00:07:34.730
"Number One"

00:07:34.860 --> 00:07:35.610
Kindness.

00:07:36.490 --> 00:07:37.230
"Number Two"

00:07:37.980 --> 00:07:38.670
Thoughtfulness.

00:07:38.150 --> 00:07:39.450
Why, thank you.

00:07:39.580 --> 00:07:41.110
In other words, your personality is important.

00:07:43.110 --> 00:07:46.080
Your heart matters more than how you look.

00:07:46.590 --> 00:07:50.540
And the best way to show him my kindness and thoughtfulness is...

00:07:50.660 --> 00:07:52.090
There's only one thing to do.

00:07:52.510 --> 00:07:53.430
What?

00:07:56.550 --> 00:07:57.540
Cooking!

00:08:03.320 --> 00:08:05.730
Anzu, are you sure you can do it yourself?

00:08:06.090 --> 00:08:07.280
I'm fine.

00:08:07.410 --> 00:08:09.600
I'm going to put lots of my love in it.

00:08:09.830 --> 00:08:12.230
Once Tsuchi eats this, he'll be madly in love with me.

00:08:12.530 --> 00:08:15.300
I see, you're making something for Tsuchi.

00:08:15.660 --> 00:08:16.900
Give it your best shot.

00:08:17.110 --> 00:08:19.600
Love is the most powerful ingredient.

00:08:19.920 --> 00:08:21.510
My love?

00:08:21.640 --> 00:08:22.510
What do you mean?

00:08:22.640 --> 00:08:25.020
It works like a charm.

00:08:26.640 --> 00:08:27.920
Well, do your best.

00:08:28.510 --> 00:08:29.410
Okay!

00:08:42.210 --> 00:08:45.120
Uh, is this supposed to be food?

00:08:45.550 --> 00:08:50.000
I know you're a bachelor living on convenience store lunches, so I made something for you.

00:08:50.210 --> 00:08:51.840
A doting wife's lunch!

00:08:52.580 --> 00:08:54.930
What did you put in there?

00:08:55.350 --> 00:08:56.170
Let's see...

00:08:56.320 --> 00:08:59.350
Vegetables, fish, green juice, and tomato juice.

00:08:59.680 --> 00:09:02.150
I also put in liver and eel to help you keep up your stamina.

00:09:02.630 --> 00:09:05.530
And I stewed it with love!

00:09:06.320 --> 00:09:07.360
Have some.

00:09:13.270 --> 00:09:15.250
I can't do it! I can't eat this!

00:09:15.360 --> 00:09:17.630
What? Of course you can eat it.

00:09:17.920 --> 00:09:20.570
It may not look good, but it's delicious.

00:09:24.860 --> 00:09:25.480
Anzu?

00:09:27.580 --> 00:09:29.400
"Bathroom"

00:09:30.070 --> 00:09:31.160
Are you okay?

00:09:31.600 --> 00:09:32.800
Y-yes...

00:09:34.190 --> 00:09:36.800
Tsuchi's face is so close.

00:09:37.090 --> 00:09:40.190
I have butterflies in my stomach!

00:09:42.460 --> 00:09:45.000
You want to kiss after throwing up?

00:09:46.810 --> 00:09:49.820
What were you thinking, making lunch for me?

00:09:50.130 --> 00:09:52.450
I want to grow up as fast as possible.

00:09:53.280 --> 00:09:53.940
Grow up?

00:09:54.210 --> 00:09:58.210
You won't consider me because I'm a child, right?

00:09:59.010 --> 00:10:02.010
I want to become an adult as soon as possible.

00:10:02.920 --> 00:10:03.660
Anzu...

00:10:04.280 --> 00:10:08.070
And then I'll resolve our love triangle with Yamamoto-sensei!

00:10:08.560 --> 00:10:10.380
L-love triangle...

00:10:11.970 --> 00:10:17.620
Do all the kids know how I feel about Yamamoto-sensei?

00:10:20.370 --> 00:10:23.130
Listen, Anzu. Being an adult isn't easy.

00:10:23.570 --> 00:10:26.940
You have to work, and you have to be mindful of others.

00:10:27.650 --> 00:10:32.660
When you're an adult, you can't just tell people you like them any more.

00:10:33.020 --> 00:10:33.920
Really?

00:10:35.580 --> 00:10:36.500
Probably.

00:10:37.170 --> 00:10:39.290
Can't children fall in love?

00:10:39.890 --> 00:10:44.140
Well, it's hard for me to comment on that...

00:10:46.260 --> 00:10:47.720
...but I'm sure you can.

00:10:48.480 --> 00:10:51.230
Children fall in love in their own way.

00:10:52.540 --> 00:10:53.150
Okay!

00:10:56.340 --> 00:10:58.750
I love you, Tsuchi!

00:10:58.910 --> 00:10:59.880
Hey, now.

00:11:01.560 --> 00:11:04.470
Hey Tsuchida, let's wrestle!

00:11:04.770 --> 00:11:08.080
If you wrestle with us, we'll teach you some tricks to Dragon Quest!

00:11:08.580 --> 00:11:10.040
Tricks? Really?

00:11:10.630 --> 00:11:12.220
Count me in!

00:11:16.520 --> 00:11:18.930
Animal Ranger Kick!

00:11:19.640 --> 00:11:22.010
Hey! Attacking from behind isn't fair!

00:11:22.600 --> 00:11:23.760
You're pretty tough, Tsuchida!

00:11:24.420 --> 00:11:25.550
Watch your tone with me!

00:11:26.350 --> 00:11:28.450
Everyone's having fun.

00:11:28.690 --> 00:11:32.610
Now that I think about it, is Tsuchi really an adult?

00:11:33.040 --> 00:11:35.420
There are many types of adults.

00:11:38.540 --> 00:11:41.410
Look at Tsuchida-kun go!

00:11:42.840 --> 00:11:46.090
Tsuchida-sensei is always having fun.

00:12:12.860 --> 00:12:15.340
I hope today's another good day.

00:12:20.090 --> 00:12:21.750
Good morning, Nana-chan.

00:12:21.950 --> 00:12:22.780
Good morning.

00:12:23.020 --> 00:12:24.670
Looks like you were able to get up by yourself today.

00:12:26.850 --> 00:12:29.100
I got another email from dad.

00:12:29.270 --> 00:12:31.050
I got one, too.

00:12:31.410 --> 00:12:36.360
He wanted to know how I was doing and to tell him if I needed anything.

00:12:36.810 --> 00:12:38.250
That's more or less the same as mine.

00:12:38.800 --> 00:12:41.850
Our dad worries too much.

00:12:43.620 --> 00:12:45.400
Father, mother...

00:12:45.890 --> 00:12:49.440
Thank you for the wonderful teacups and saucers.

00:12:50.030 --> 00:12:51.970
They make tea taste better.

00:12:53.400 --> 00:12:56.200
Today, I'd like to write to you about my day.

00:13:02.290 --> 00:13:04.430
It's already that time of year.

00:13:05.870 --> 00:13:08.240
"A Hanamaru Day"

00:13:08.240 --> 00:13:11.490
"Faculty Office"

00:13:09.060 --> 00:13:11.360
I always go to work a little early...

00:13:11.500 --> 00:13:13.580
...and prepare for that day's class.

00:13:14.390 --> 00:13:19.070
I work at a leisurely pace, so I have to spend more time preparing than others.

00:13:19.980 --> 00:13:20.800
Good morning.

00:13:21.480 --> 00:13:23.360
You're here early as usual.

00:13:23.730 --> 00:13:24.870
Good morning.

00:13:28.810 --> 00:13:30.830
Sorry I'm late.

00:13:31.310 --> 00:13:33.330
Tsuchida-kun, you're late again.

00:13:33.610 --> 00:13:35.800
I bet you were up all night playing games.

00:13:35.900 --> 00:13:38.010
What? How did you know?

00:13:38.200 --> 00:13:39.240
Looks like I hit the nail on the head.

00:13:39.530 --> 00:13:42.640
Kusano-chan, no one says that any more.

00:13:42.690 --> 00:13:44.390
What? Really?

00:13:44.510 --> 00:13:46.220
They're all good people.

00:13:46.590 --> 00:13:48.170
It's a wonderful workplace.

00:13:49.390 --> 00:13:52.110
What a delicious looking princess.

00:13:52.630 --> 00:13:55.030
I'll have you for dinner!

00:13:55.330 --> 00:13:57.440
Somebody, please save me!

00:13:57.850 --> 00:14:00.840
Oh, no! The princess is in trouble.

00:14:01.200 --> 00:14:02.180
What will she do?

00:14:02.310 --> 00:14:04.330
Someone will come save her.

00:14:04.570 --> 00:14:06.330
The prince will come for her.

00:14:06.420 --> 00:14:11.090
Yes. The prince was walking in the woods looking for the princess.

00:14:11.430 --> 00:14:15.460
But the forest is vast, and he was having trouble finding the princess.

00:14:15.560 --> 00:14:16.230
What?

00:14:16.230 --> 00:14:17.940
You can do it, prince!

00:14:18.000 --> 00:14:21.610
I told you about the children in Peach Class the last time I wrote to you.

00:14:22.320 --> 00:14:23.810
They're all good kids.

00:14:23.810 --> 00:14:26.190
They play with such energy every day.

00:14:28.280 --> 00:14:30.270
Sensei, let's trade side dishes.

00:14:30.560 --> 00:14:31.230
Sure.

00:14:31.500 --> 00:14:32.990
Sensei, me too.

00:14:33.090 --> 00:14:33.690
Okay.

00:14:36.000 --> 00:14:38.950
Recently, I've made friends in the Sakura Class, too.

00:14:39.980 --> 00:14:41.360
This is Hiiragi-chan.

00:14:42.910 --> 00:14:43.730
Hello.

00:14:44.180 --> 00:14:46.460
Hiiragi-chan, are you reading by yourself?

00:14:47.350 --> 00:14:49.550
Hello, Yamamoto-sensei.

00:14:50.050 --> 00:14:53.260
I intend to finish reading this book by the end of this week.

00:14:53.660 --> 00:14:56.290
Hiiragi-chan is always calm and collected...

00:14:56.380 --> 00:14:58.010
...and she's very knowledgeable.

00:14:58.330 --> 00:15:00.690
You're wearing a panda-cat outfit today.

00:15:01.010 --> 00:15:02.250
It's very cute.

00:15:06.610 --> 00:15:09.980
Pa-pa-pa-pa panda-cat.

00:15:10.210 --> 00:15:13.590
Pa-pa-pa-pa panda-cat.

00:15:11.620 --> 00:15:14.450
Hiiragi-chan often wears cute clothes.

00:15:13.980 --> 00:15:17.480
Pa-pa-pa-pa panda-cat.

00:15:15.130 --> 00:15:17.480
She's also a little shy.

00:15:22.680 --> 00:15:27.880
I let the boys borrow my panda-cat and they tore its ear off.

00:15:27.880 --> 00:15:29.340
They're so mean.

00:15:29.340 --> 00:15:31.630
Poor panda-cat.

00:15:32.510 --> 00:15:35.630
Don't worry. I'll fix it for you.

00:15:36.830 --> 00:15:38.000
Really?

00:15:38.320 --> 00:15:40.110
Yes. Leave it to me.

00:15:40.700 --> 00:15:43.950
Koume-chan is shy, but she's a very kind girl.

00:15:52.160 --> 00:15:53.880
I can't be too forceful.

00:15:54.000 --> 00:15:55.400
I've got to sound casual.

00:15:57.040 --> 00:15:58.010
Yamamoto-sensei.

00:15:58.520 --> 00:15:59.280
Yes?

00:15:59.470 --> 00:16:03.840
Thanks for looking after my students.

00:16:03.970 --> 00:16:04.870
Don't mention it.

00:16:05.720 --> 00:16:07.900
Tsuchida-sensei is a male teacher.

00:16:08.190 --> 00:16:09.990
He is always kind to me.

00:16:11.670 --> 00:16:15.450
Actually, I got some tickets to an amusement park from a friend.

00:16:15.840 --> 00:16:18.470
I don't have many friends in this city yet, so...

00:16:19.060 --> 00:16:20.950
...would you like to go with me?

00:16:23.040 --> 00:16:24.100
Really?

00:16:25.860 --> 00:16:27.230
I did it!

00:16:26.190 --> 00:16:28.050
Tsuchida's confessing his love!

00:16:28.400 --> 00:16:30.250
Hey, you're right!

00:16:31.840 --> 00:16:33.420
Shut up, you brats!

00:16:35.160 --> 00:16:38.160
These are tickets to the amusement park everyone is talking about.

00:16:38.910 --> 00:16:41.480
Anzu-chan was talking about how she wanted to go.

00:16:43.100 --> 00:16:45.960
I don't mind, so why don't you go with Anzu-chan?

00:16:46.120 --> 00:16:50.680
Huh? But I wanted to...

00:16:50.330 --> 00:16:52.450
Anzu-chan would be very happy.

00:16:52.920 --> 00:16:55.880
I'm sure she would be, but...

00:16:59.570 --> 00:17:00.030
Okay.

00:17:01.090 --> 00:17:03.350
That's no way to ask a girl on a date.

00:17:03.580 --> 00:17:05.850
Please don't cry, Tsuchida-sensei.

00:17:06.110 --> 00:17:07.570
Thanks...

00:17:08.160 --> 00:17:13.940
Tsuchida-sensei hasn't been at the kindergarten long, but he's already made friends with the children.

00:17:14.500 --> 00:17:16.030
I'm a little jealous.

00:17:17.690 --> 00:17:20.040
I wonder why he seems disappointed.

00:17:20.810 --> 00:17:24.420
What? Tsuchi asked Yamamoto-sensei on a date?

00:17:24.620 --> 00:17:26.510
Yeah. She turned him down, though.

00:17:26.510 --> 00:17:27.870
Th-that's...

00:17:28.070 --> 00:17:30.240
What are you going to do about this, Anzu-san?

00:17:32.560 --> 00:17:34.670
This means war!

00:17:35.490 --> 00:17:36.630
Yamamoto-sensei!

00:17:37.730 --> 00:17:39.590
What's wrong, Anzu-chan?

00:17:40.070 --> 00:17:41.900
There's something I want to tell you.

00:17:42.000 --> 00:17:43.190
What is it?

00:17:43.840 --> 00:17:45.840
I like Tsuchi!

00:17:46.590 --> 00:17:48.690
I like Tsuchida-sensei, too.

00:17:50.100 --> 00:17:51.100
R-really?

00:17:51.890 --> 00:17:54.360
And I like you too, Anzu-chan.

00:18:02.100 --> 00:18:04.660
I like you too, Yamamoto-sensei!

00:18:05.740 --> 00:18:08.220
Really? I'm glad you do.

00:18:08.780 --> 00:18:11.560
Anzu-chan is a very lively little girl.

00:18:11.870 --> 00:18:13.920
She loves Tsuchida-sensei.

00:18:14.200 --> 00:18:14.750
Huh?

00:18:16.420 --> 00:18:17.230
Wait a minute.

00:18:17.520 --> 00:18:19.680
How did this happen?

00:18:26.820 --> 00:18:28.620
My work isn't over yet.

00:18:29.430 --> 00:18:32.750
It's not uncommon for me to stay at the kindergarten until after dark.

00:18:33.700 --> 00:18:39.350
But I wouldn't say I dislike those quiet hours after the children have gone home.

00:18:43.910 --> 00:18:44.560
Done.

00:18:45.430 --> 00:18:47.880
I hope Koume-chan likes it.

00:18:54.090 --> 00:18:57.270
Okay, that'll be 500 yen.

00:18:58.000 --> 00:18:59.070
Are you sure?

00:18:59.890 --> 00:19:01.180
Thank you.

00:19:01.740 --> 00:19:03.550
Come back soon.

00:19:05.640 --> 00:19:08.640
What a bright young lady.

00:19:08.830 --> 00:19:11.980
I always give her too great a discount when I see her face.

00:19:12.370 --> 00:19:14.390
Are you sure I can have all of these?

00:19:14.790 --> 00:19:16.050
Of course.

00:19:16.410 --> 00:19:17.910
No one's buying them anyway.

00:19:20.290 --> 00:19:21.170
Hello.

00:19:21.230 --> 00:19:22.830
Hello.

00:19:24.080 --> 00:19:24.870
Hello.

00:19:25.230 --> 00:19:27.700
Oh, uh... hello.

00:19:30.780 --> 00:19:33.660
What are you being friendly for, bro?

00:19:34.070 --> 00:19:37.750
I just can't help myself around that girl.

00:19:38.850 --> 00:19:43.650
I spend each day surrounded by wonderful people.

00:19:44.620 --> 00:19:48.680
Father, mother, please look after yourselves.

00:19:51.460 --> 00:19:54.320
I'm sure we'll see a response soon.

00:19:55.130 --> 00:19:56.290
I'm sure he will.

00:19:59.480 --> 00:20:00.790
Oh, father.

00:20:00.850 --> 00:20:02.280
That's way too fast!

00:20:02.510 --> 00:20:04.950
Nanako, who is this Tsuchida guy?

00:20:05.280 --> 00:20:08.280
Do you like him? Is he your boyfriend? Are you dating?

00:20:08.690 --> 00:20:11.680
So that's why you were depressed.

00:20:11.980 --> 00:20:16.950
I don't think Nana-chan turned you down because she doesn't want to date you.

00:20:17.350 --> 00:20:18.460
Really?

00:20:18.740 --> 00:20:22.480
She probably really did think it would make Anzu-chan happy.

00:20:22.610 --> 00:20:24.040
Don't be ridiculous.

00:20:24.380 --> 00:20:26.300
No matter how you look at it, I was...

00:20:26.790 --> 00:20:29.580
Nana-chan doesn't notice that kind of thing.

00:20:29.720 --> 00:20:32.670
When it comes to love, she's ridiculously clueless.

00:20:32.890 --> 00:20:33.740
Clueless?

00:20:33.870 --> 00:20:34.390
Yeah.

00:20:35.240 --> 00:20:36.090
Ridiculously?

00:20:36.480 --> 00:20:39.300
She could make it into the Guiness Book of World Records.

00:20:40.020 --> 00:20:41.740
There's a lot you don't know about the world.

00:20:42.200 --> 00:20:46.620
I was just worried you were being fooled by some immoral man.

00:20:47.140 --> 00:20:48.520
Thank you, father...

00:20:48.770 --> 00:20:51.210
...but nothing has changed.

00:20:51.470 --> 00:20:54.080
Men aren't interested in me.

00:20:54.890 --> 00:20:58.210
Yes. Tsuchida-sensei is kind to me...

00:20:58.530 --> 00:20:59.800
...but it's nothing like that.

00:21:00.650 --> 00:21:03.070
She hasn't changed a bit.

00:21:04.200 --> 00:21:08.060
I've known her since we went to school together, and it's unbelievable.

00:21:08.240 --> 00:21:14.520
No matter how openly boys approached her, she never thought they liked her.

00:21:15.320 --> 00:21:19.590
She must be unable to realize she's the object of someone's affection.

00:21:19.840 --> 00:21:20.960
That's ridiculous.

00:21:21.450 --> 00:21:26.230
Even my students have realized how I feel about Yamamoto-sensei.

00:21:26.790 --> 00:21:29.450
Really? Your students have noticed?

00:21:29.770 --> 00:21:31.670
There's got to be something wrong with that.

00:21:32.040 --> 00:21:33.490
You're probably right...

00:21:33.930 --> 00:21:37.150
She's so cute, too. What a waste.

00:21:37.380 --> 00:21:40.380
I know, right? It won't be easy, Tsuchida-kun.

00:21:40.600 --> 00:21:41.590
You can do it!

00:21:44.860 --> 00:21:47.630
What am I supposed to do?

00:21:48.410 --> 00:21:52.310
Yes, but I'm having so much fun.

00:21:52.310 --> 00:21:55.440
You don't need to worry about me, father.

00:23:30.910 --> 00:23:31.690
This is Tsuchida.

00:23:31.810 --> 00:23:36.390
Apparently, Yamamoto-sensei can't realize she's the object of someone's affection.

00:23:36.470 --> 00:23:38.260
I don't even have time to worry about that!

00:23:38.350 --> 00:23:39.870
Go ahead, Yamamoto-sensei!

00:23:39.870 --> 00:23:41.060
Of course.

00:23:41.150 --> 00:23:43.360
The next episode is about Anzu's date and helping.

00:23:42.220 --> 00:23:43.500
"A Hanamaru Date"

00:23:43.360 --> 00:23:44.180
Don't miss it!

00:23:43.520 --> 00:23:44.790
"A Hanamaru Helper"

00:23:44.800 --> 00:23:49.560
"See you next time!"
